--- !u!114 &665260693
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 665260691}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b096626d39e2f7dd882348b9cb85cb8b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GlorifiedBody.Interaction.InWorldScreen
  range: 1.6
  point: {fileID: 1172892659}
  clip: {fileID: 0}
  faces:
  - {fileID: 765271646}
  lines:
  - at: 1
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: Welcome. If you are watching this, someone you love is very sick. We are
      so sorry.
  - at: 7.31
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: We want to tell you what the Translation is, and what it asks.
  - at: 12.52
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: The first bodies were steel. Those who chose them gave up warmth, so that
      others would not have to.
  - at: 19.765001
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: The second bodies were better. Still not enough.
  - at: 24.205002
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: The third body feels. It heals. It does not sicken, it does not age, and
      it does not tire.
  - at: 30.955002
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: We call it the Glorified Body.
  - at: 34.405003
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: The Translation hurts. We will never tell you otherwise. There is a swelling,
      and there are weeks of
  - at: 41.705
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: Your child will not be alone. Not for one hour.
  - at: 46.090004
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: We cover the face we were born with. Not from shame. From hope.
  - at: 51.355003
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: Whatever you decide tonight, you are family here.
  - at: 55.850002
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: So that humanity endures.
  interactive: 1
  loop: 1
  hearing: 12
  volume: 1
  ducksMusic: 1
  pausesTape: 1
  thing: the screen
